# Milestone: v0.6.2 — Phase 6 (.u overlay).
# Covers: Integer and Float extension methods declared in
#         src/stdlib/number.u via the class-body / addProto pattern.
#
# Integer methods: sqr, abs, sign, even, odd.
# Float methods: sqr, sign.
#
# Gap requirements: multi-slot class body (Gap #2, v0.6.2), this
# resolution (Gap #3, v0.6.2).

# Integer.sqr: square of positive integer.
5.sqr()
[00000000] 25

# Integer.abs: absolute value of negative integer.
(-3).abs()
[00000001] 3

# Integer.sign: negative, zero, positive.
(-5).sign()
[00000002] -1

0.sign()
[00000003] 0

4.sign()
[00000004] 1

# Integer.even: parity check.
4.even()
[00000005] true

3.even()
[00000006] false

# Integer.odd: parity check.
3.odd()
[00000007] true

4.odd()
[00000008] false

# Float.sqr: square of a float.
2.5.sqr()
[00000009] 6.25

# Float.sign: negative, zero, positive.
(-1.5).sign()
[00000010] -1

1.5.sign()
[00000011] 1

0.0.sign()
[00000012] 0
